.github/styles/write-good/
.github/styles/proselint/

# Playwright artifacts. The e2e suite writes traces, screenshots and
# the HTML report here on every run (apps/web/tests/e2e/test-results),
# and the CI preset writes the HTML report to its own path.
apps/web/tests/e2e/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/
